{
  "book": "helaman",
  "bookName": "Helaman",
  "chapter": 16,
  "voice": {
    "provider": "elevenlabs",
    "voice_id": "ddDFRErfhdc2asyySOG5",
    "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
    "settings": {
      "stability": 0.5,
      "similarity_boost": 0.75,
      "style": 0.35,
      "use_speaker_boost": true
    },
    "name": "Samuel"
  },
  "pauses": {
    "line_ms": 180,
    "verse_ms": 500
  },
  "duration": 371.953,
  "lines": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 5.805,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now, it came to pass that there were many who heard the words of Samuel, the Lamanite,",
      "verse": "16:1",
      "lineIndex": 1
    },
    {
      "start": 5.985,
      "end": 8.632,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which he spake upon the walls of the city.",
      "verse": "16:1",
      "lineIndex": 2
    },
    {
      "start": 8.812,
      "end": 12.759,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And as many as believed on his word went forth and sought for Nephi;",
      "verse": "16:1",
      "lineIndex": 3
    },
    {
      "start": 12.939,
      "end": 15.633,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and when they had come forth and found him",
      "verse": "16:1",
      "lineIndex": 4
    },
    {
      "start": 15.813,
      "end": 22.036,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "they confessed unto him their sins and denied not, desiring that they might be baptized unto the Lord.",
      "verse": "16:1",
      "lineIndex": 5
    },
    {
      "start": 22.716,
      "end": 24.434,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But as many as there were",
      "verse": "16:2",
      "lineIndex": 6
    },
    {
      "start": 24.614,
      "end": 28.608,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "who did not believe in the words of Samuel were angry with him;",
      "verse": "16:2",
      "lineIndex": 7
    },
    {
      "start": 28.788,
      "end": 31.528,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they cast stones at him upon the wall,",
      "verse": "16:2",
      "lineIndex": 8
    },
    {
      "start": 31.708,
      "end": 35.516,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and also many shot arrows at him as he stood upon the wall;",
      "verse": "16:2",
      "lineIndex": 9
    },
    {
      "start": 35.696,
      "end": 38.25,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but the Spirit of the Lord was with him,",
      "verse": "16:2",
      "lineIndex": 10
    },
    {
      "start": 38.43,
      "end": 43.724,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "insomuch that they could not hit him with their stones neither with their arrows.",
      "verse": "16:2",
      "lineIndex": 11
    },
    {
      "start": 44.404,
      "end": 46.912,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now when they saw that they could not hit him,",
      "verse": "16:3",
      "lineIndex": 12
    },
    {
      "start": 47.092,
      "end": 55.08,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "there were many more who did believe on his words, insomuch that they went away unto Nephi to be baptized.",
      "verse": "16:3",
      "lineIndex": 13
    },
    {
      "start": 55.76,
      "end": 57.989,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For behold, Nephi was baptizing,",
      "verse": "16:4",
      "lineIndex": 14
    },
    {
      "start": 58.169,
      "end": 59.609,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and prophesying,",
      "verse": "16:4",
      "lineIndex": 15
    },
    {
      "start": 59.789,
      "end": 61.043,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and preaching,",
      "verse": "16:4",
      "lineIndex": 16
    },
    {
      "start": 61.223,
      "end": 68.328,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "crying repentance unto the people, showing signs and wonders, working miracles among the people,",
      "verse": "16:4",
      "lineIndex": 17
    },
    {
      "start": 68.508,
      "end": 72.084,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that they might know that the Christ must shortly come\u2014",
      "verse": "16:4",
      "lineIndex": 18
    },
    {
      "start": 72.764,
      "end": 75.597,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Telling them of things which must shortly come,",
      "verse": "16:5",
      "lineIndex": 19
    },
    {
      "start": 75.777,
      "end": 82.929,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that they might know and remember at the time of their coming that they had been made known unto them beforehand,",
      "verse": "16:5",
      "lineIndex": 20
    },
    {
      "start": 83.109,
      "end": 85.71,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "to the intent that they might believe;",
      "verse": "16:5",
      "lineIndex": 21
    },
    {
      "start": 85.89,
      "end": 89.327,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "therefore as many as believed on the words of Samuel",
      "verse": "16:5",
      "lineIndex": 22
    },
    {
      "start": 89.507,
      "end": 91.922,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "went forth unto him to be baptized,",
      "verse": "16:5",
      "lineIndex": 23
    },
    {
      "start": 92.102,
      "end": 95.26,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for they came repenting and confessing their sins.",
      "verse": "16:5",
      "lineIndex": 24
    },
    {
      "start": 95.94,
      "end": 100.445,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But the more part of them did not believe in the words of Samuel;",
      "verse": "16:6",
      "lineIndex": 25
    },
    {
      "start": 100.625,
      "end": 105.269,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "therefore when they saw that they could not hit him with their stones and their arrows,",
      "verse": "16:6",
      "lineIndex": 26
    },
    {
      "start": 105.449,
      "end": 107.91,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "they cried unto their captains, saying:",
      "verse": "16:6",
      "lineIndex": 27
    },
    {
      "start": 108.09,
      "end": 110.087,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Take this fellow and bind him,",
      "verse": "16:6",
      "lineIndex": 28
    },
    {
      "start": 110.267,
      "end": 112.171,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for behold he hath a devil;",
      "verse": "16:6",
      "lineIndex": 29
    },
    {
      "start": 112.351,
      "end": 115.695,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and because of the power of the devil which is in him",
      "verse": "16:6",
      "lineIndex": 30
    },
    {
      "start": 115.875,
      "end": 119.219,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "we cannot hit him with our stones and our arrows;",
      "verse": "16:6",
      "lineIndex": 31
    },
    {
      "start": 119.399,
      "end": 122.51,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "therefore take him and bind him, and away with him.",
      "verse": "16:6",
      "lineIndex": 32
    },
    {
      "start": 123.19,
      "end": 125.791,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And as they went forth to lay their hands on him,",
      "verse": "16:7",
      "lineIndex": 33
    },
    {
      "start": 125.971,
      "end": 129.036,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "behold, he did cast himself down from the wall,",
      "verse": "16:7",
      "lineIndex": 34
    },
    {
      "start": 129.216,
      "end": 134.046,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and did flee out of their lands, yea, even unto his own country,",
      "verse": "16:7",
      "lineIndex": 35
    },
    {
      "start": 134.226,
      "end": 137.616,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and began to preach and to prophesy among his own people.",
      "verse": "16:7",
      "lineIndex": 36
    },
    {
      "start": 138.296,
      "end": 142.058,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And behold, he was never heard of more among the Nephites;",
      "verse": "16:8",
      "lineIndex": 38
    },
    {
      "start": 142.238,
      "end": 144.467,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and thus were the affairs of the people.",
      "verse": "16:8",
      "lineIndex": 39
    },
    {
      "start": 145.147,
      "end": 150.441,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And thus ended the eighty and sixth year of the reign of the judges over the people of Nephi.",
      "verse": "16:9",
      "lineIndex": 40
    },
    {
      "start": 151.121,
      "end": 155.904,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And thus ended also the eighty and seventh year of the reign of the judges,",
      "verse": "16:10",
      "lineIndex": 41
    },
    {
      "start": 156.084,
      "end": 160.31,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "the more part of the people remaining in their pride and wickedness,",
      "verse": "16:10",
      "lineIndex": 42
    },
    {
      "start": 160.49,
      "end": 164.159,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the lesser part walking more circumspectly before God.",
      "verse": "16:10",
      "lineIndex": 43
    },
    {
      "start": 164.839,
      "end": 171.573,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And these were the conditions also, in the eighty and eighth year of the reign of the judges.",
      "verse": "16:11",
      "lineIndex": 44
    },
    {
      "start": 172.253,
      "end": 176.758,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And there was but little alteration in the affairs of the people,",
      "verse": "16:12",
      "lineIndex": 45
    },
    {
      "start": 176.938,
      "end": 181.164,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "save it were the people began to be more hardened in iniquity,",
      "verse": "16:12",
      "lineIndex": 46
    },
    {
      "start": 181.344,
      "end": 189.146,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and do more and more of that which was contrary to the commandments of God, in the eighty and ninth year of the reign of the judges.",
      "verse": "16:12",
      "lineIndex": 47
    },
    {
      "start": 189.826,
      "end": 198.65,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But it came to pass in the ninetieth year of the reign of the judges, there were great signs given unto the people, and wonders;",
      "verse": "16:13",
      "lineIndex": 49
    },
    {
      "start": 198.83,
      "end": 201.941,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the words of the prophets began to be fulfilled.",
      "verse": "16:13",
      "lineIndex": 50
    },
    {
      "start": 202.621,
      "end": 205.686,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And angels did appear unto men, wise men,",
      "verse": "16:14",
      "lineIndex": 51
    },
    {
      "start": 205.866,
      "end": 209.535,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and did declare unto them glad tidings of great joy;",
      "verse": "16:14",
      "lineIndex": 52
    },
    {
      "start": 209.715,
      "end": 212.966,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "thus in this year the scriptures began to be fulfilled.",
      "verse": "16:14",
      "lineIndex": 53
    },
    {
      "start": 213.646,
      "end": 216.757,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Nevertheless, the people began to harden their hearts,",
      "verse": "16:15",
      "lineIndex": 54
    },
    {
      "start": 216.937,
      "end": 220.048,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "all save it were the most believing part of them,",
      "verse": "16:15",
      "lineIndex": 55
    },
    {
      "start": 220.228,
      "end": 223.061,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "both of the Nephites and also of the Lamanites,",
      "verse": "16:15",
      "lineIndex": 56
    },
    {
      "start": 223.241,
      "end": 226.399,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and began to depend upon their own strength",
      "verse": "16:15",
      "lineIndex": 57
    },
    {
      "start": 226.579,
      "end": 228.901,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and upon their own wisdom, saying:",
      "verse": "16:15",
      "lineIndex": 58
    },
    {
      "start": 229.581,
      "end": 233.157,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Some things they may have guessed right, among so many;",
      "verse": "16:16",
      "lineIndex": 59
    },
    {
      "start": 233.337,
      "end": 236.727,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but behold, we know that all these great and marvelous works",
      "verse": "16:16",
      "lineIndex": 60
    },
    {
      "start": 236.907,
      "end": 240.018,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "cannot come to pass, of which has been spoken.",
      "verse": "16:16",
      "lineIndex": 61
    },
    {
      "start": 240.698,
      "end": 244.738,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And they began to reason and to contend among themselves, saying:",
      "verse": "16:17",
      "lineIndex": 62
    },
    {
      "start": 245.418,
      "end": 249.226,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "That it is not reasonable that such a being as a Christ shall come;",
      "verse": "16:18",
      "lineIndex": 64
    },
    {
      "start": 249.406,
      "end": 251.728,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "if so, and he be the Son of God,",
      "verse": "16:18",
      "lineIndex": 65
    },
    {
      "start": 251.908,
      "end": 255.577,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "the Father of heaven and of earth, as it has been spoken,",
      "verse": "16:18",
      "lineIndex": 66
    },
    {
      "start": 255.757,
      "end": 258.218,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "why will he not show himself unto us",
      "verse": "16:18",
      "lineIndex": 67
    },
    {
      "start": 258.398,
      "end": 261.417,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "as well as unto them who shall be at Jerusalem?",
      "verse": "16:18",
      "lineIndex": 68
    },
    {
      "start": 262.097,
      "end": 264.791,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Yea, why will he not show himself in this land",
      "verse": "16:19",
      "lineIndex": 69
    },
    {
      "start": 264.971,
      "end": 267.2,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "as well as in the land of Jerusalem?",
      "verse": "16:19",
      "lineIndex": 70
    },
    {
      "start": 267.88,
      "end": 271.456,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But behold, we know that this is a wicked tradition,",
      "verse": "16:20",
      "lineIndex": 71
    },
    {
      "start": 271.636,
      "end": 274.794,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which has been handed down unto us by our fathers,",
      "verse": "16:20",
      "lineIndex": 72
    },
    {
      "start": 274.974,
      "end": 277.342,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "to cause us that we should believe",
      "verse": "16:20",
      "lineIndex": 73
    },
    {
      "start": 277.522,
      "end": 280.866,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "in some great and marvelous thing which should come to pass,",
      "verse": "16:20",
      "lineIndex": 74
    },
    {
      "start": 281.046,
      "end": 286.201,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but not among us, but in a land which is far distant, a land which we know not;",
      "verse": "16:20",
      "lineIndex": 75
    },
    {
      "start": 286.381,
      "end": 288.796,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "therefore they can keep us in ignorance,",
      "verse": "16:20",
      "lineIndex": 76
    },
    {
      "start": 288.976,
      "end": 292.273,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for we cannot witness with our own eyes that they are true.",
      "verse": "16:20",
      "lineIndex": 77
    },
    {
      "start": 292.953,
      "end": 297.69,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And they will, by the cunning and the mysterious arts of the evil one,",
      "verse": "16:21",
      "lineIndex": 78
    },
    {
      "start": 297.87,
      "end": 300.981,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "work some great mystery which we cannot understand,",
      "verse": "16:21",
      "lineIndex": 79
    },
    {
      "start": 301.161,
      "end": 304.04,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which will keep us down to be servants",
      "verse": "16:21",
      "lineIndex": 80
    },
    {
      "start": 304.22,
      "end": 307.239,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "to their words, and also servants unto them,",
      "verse": "16:21",
      "lineIndex": 81
    },
    {
      "start": 307.419,
      "end": 310.577,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for we depend upon them to teach us the word;",
      "verse": "16:21",
      "lineIndex": 82
    },
    {
      "start": 310.757,
      "end": 313.079,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and thus will they keep us in ignorance",
      "verse": "16:21",
      "lineIndex": 83
    },
    {
      "start": 313.259,
      "end": 317.531,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "if we will yield ourselves unto them, all the days of our lives.",
      "verse": "16:21",
      "lineIndex": 84
    },
    {
      "start": 318.211,
      "end": 325.038,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And many more things did the people imagine up in their hearts, which were foolish and vain;",
      "verse": "16:22",
      "lineIndex": 85
    },
    {
      "start": 325.218,
      "end": 326.936,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they were much disturbed,",
      "verse": "16:22",
      "lineIndex": 86
    },
    {
      "start": 327.116,
      "end": 330.785,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for Satan did stir them up to do iniquity continually;",
      "verse": "16:22",
      "lineIndex": 87
    },
    {
      "start": 330.965,
      "end": 336.491,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, he did go about spreading rumors and contentions upon all the face of the land,",
      "verse": "16:22",
      "lineIndex": 88
    },
    {
      "start": 336.671,
      "end": 342.104,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that he might harden the hearts of the people against that which was good",
      "verse": "16:22",
      "lineIndex": 89
    },
    {
      "start": 342.284,
      "end": 344.745,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and against that which should come.",
      "verse": "16:22",
      "lineIndex": 90
    },
    {
      "start": 345.425,
      "end": 348.536,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And notwithstanding the signs and the wonders",
      "verse": "16:23",
      "lineIndex": 91
    },
    {
      "start": 348.716,
      "end": 352.292,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which were wrought among the people of the Lord,",
      "verse": "16:23",
      "lineIndex": 92
    },
    {
      "start": 352.472,
      "end": 354.562,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the many miracles which they did,",
      "verse": "16:23",
      "lineIndex": 93
    },
    {
      "start": 354.742,
      "end": 359.711,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Satan did get great hold upon the hearts of the people upon all the face of the land.",
      "verse": "16:23",
      "lineIndex": 94
    },
    {
      "start": 360.391,
      "end": 365.778,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And thus ended the ninetieth year of the reign of the judges over the people of Nephi.",
      "verse": "16:24",
      "lineIndex": 95
    },
    {
      "start": 366.458,
      "end": 371.288,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And thus ended the book of Helaman, according to the record of Helaman and his sons.",
      "verse": "16:25",
      "lineIndex": 96
    }
  ]
}